      "cause": "`AppError` stores the code on `err.status`, but the handler reads `err.statusCode` → undefined → falls back to 500. Every typed error (400/403/404/409) shows up as 500.",
      "fix": "`const status = err.status || 500;`",
      "pattern": "Error middleware reads the wrong property"
    },
