        "De Morgan: NOT (A OR B) is (NOT A) AND (NOT B)."
      ],
      "cause": "`authorId !== user.id || role !== 'agent'` is true for everyone except an agent who is also the author. The forbidden check needs `&&`.",
      "fix": "`if (ticket.authorId !== user.id && user.role !== 'agent') throw new ForbiddenError(...)`",
      "pattern": "Inverted boolean logic (|| vs &&)"
